# v6/GETTING-STARTED.md, EXECUTED. Every marked block on that page is replayed
# in one persistent shell (so the backgrounded `bop serve` and the exports
# survive across blocks, exactly as a reader's terminal does) and its captured
# output is diffed against the text the page prints. Temp paths, content
# digests and epoch buckets normalize; every relation row is compared
# literally. A doc that drifts from the engine fails here rather than in a
# stranger's first thirty minutes.
# (expect: GETTING STARTED HOLDS: 24 blocks replayed, exit 0; ~16s)
getting-started:
